Package: DiffiScape
Title: Differentiable Landscape Connectivity Optimization
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Sean", "Sorek", , "sssorek1@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Gradient-based and surrogate-based optimization of landscape
    connectivity surfaces using the independently installed 'diffiscape' Python
    package. JAX, JAXScape, Flax, Optax and NumPyro provide differentiable circuit
    calculations, resistance fitting and posterior inference. Users supply
    environmental rasters and GPS locations; the R interface preserves spatial
    metadata and plots. Built-in intensity families share the Python core;
    GAM fitting via 'mgcv' and custom R callbacks remain R-only extensions.
